  Corresponding source: https://github.com/donttellmeimcute/DM32-nxdn-p25
  The image does not contain the AMBE codec. Hardware-unverified laboratory build.

Not included
  No AMBE/AMBE+2 codec bytes (DVSI), no rfoundry_dm32.codec.bin and no Baofeng stock firmware are part of this
  repository. The flasher reads the codec from the user's radio or from a stock firmware file the user selects, and
  merges it in the browser.

